                <invention-title lang="de">ZÄHLEN VON SPIELCHIPS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">COMPTAGE DE JETONS DE JEU</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">COUNTING GAMING CHIPS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An image can be captured from an imaging device. A gaming chip tube can be identified in a gaming chip tray. A first position can be determined that corresponds to a bottom of the gaming chip tube. A spacer can be identified by recognizing a predefined pattern on the spacer. A second position can be determined corresponding to the spacer. A count of gaming chips can be determined based at least in part on the first and second positions.</p>
